{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_02415","headline":"秋夜独坐 · 袁朗","name":"秋夜独坐","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"危弦断客心，虚弹落惊禽。\n新秋百虑净，独夜九愁深。\n枯蓬唯逐吹，坠叶不归林。\n如何悲此曲，坐作白头吟。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"袁朗","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_02415.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_02415","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}